<title>UK: Barclays buys back another 10.4 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Barclays buys back another 10.4 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barclays Plc said on Wednesday that it bought a further 10.41 million shares for cancellation on Tuesday at 1096.19p per share.</p>
<p>It bought the parcel of shares from BZW.</p>
<p>The purchase was part of Barclay's plans to buy back 26 million ordinary shares representing around 1.7 percent of its issued share capital.</p>
<p>London Newsroom + 44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
